    </files>
  </knowledge>

  <steps>
    <step order="1">Confirm task 001 is ✅ completed (FR-01 framework `contentSizing` shipped).</step>
    <step order="2">Update `sectionMetadataCatalog.ts`: add `contentSizing: 'clamped'` to the 6 entries: `communications`, `documents`, `invoices`, `matters`, `projects`, `workAssignments`. (Serial — single file.)</step>
    <step order="3">**Parallel subagent decomposition** — dispatch 6 subagents (one per section file), each with instructions: "In `src/solutions/LegalWorkspace/src/sections/{sectionName}.registration.ts`, locate the `style` object in the section registration. Remove the `maxHeight: '480px'` key and the `display: 'flex'` key. Keep `overflow: 'hidden'` if present (harmless; framework applies it via contentSizing). Do not remove anything else. Return: 'edited' + git diff line count."</step>
    <step order="4">After all 6 subagents complete, grep to verify: `grep -n "maxHeight" src/solutions/LegalWorkspace/src/sections/{communications,documents,invoices,matters,projects,workAssignments}.registration.ts` → zero hits.</step>
    <step order="5">Rebuild shared lib + LegalWorkspace + SpaarkeAi: `powershell scripts/Build-AllClientComponents.ps1` (or equivalent per current script). Build succeeds.</step>
    <step order="6">Manual smoke test locally (before task 006 formal deploy): open LegalWorkspace Dashboard II — Communications section shows visible scrollbar + lazy-load on scroll. Sanity check on Documents single-section full-page: no longer capped at 480px (fills more of the tab; final `rowHeight` override lands in FR-02).</step>
    <step order="7">Update TASK-INDEX.md: status → ✅ completed.</step>
  </steps>

  <tools>
    <tool name="npm">Build</tool>
    <tool name="terminal">Grep, run build script</tool>
    <tool name="Agent">Dispatch 6 parallel subagents for identical registration edits</tool>
  </tools>

  <outputs>
    <output type="code">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/WorkspaceShell/sectionMetadataCatalog.ts (modified — 6 entries get contentSizing)</output>
    <output type="code">src/solutions/LegalWorkspace/src/sections/communications.registration.ts (modified)</output>
    <output type="code">src/solutions/LegalWorkspace/src/sections/documents.registration.ts (modified)</output>
