  </outputs>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Grep on 6 registration files finds zero `maxHeight` occurrences.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Grep on 6 metadata catalog entries confirms `contentSizing: 'clamped'` present.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`npm run build` succeeds in `Spaarke.UI.Components` + LegalWorkspace + SpaarkeAi + WorkspaceLayoutWizard.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Local smoke test: Dashboard II Communications shows visible scrollbar; page-2 fetch triggers on scroll.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes>
    - This is the payoff for FR-01 — the framework fix reaches production only after this unwind.
    - Parallel subagent pattern: dispatch all 6 in a SINGLE message with 6 Agent tool calls (concurrent). Each agent handles one file. Wait for all 6 to complete before step 4 grep verification.
    - If any subagent reports "no `maxHeight` found" (unexpected), investigate — either the file was already cleaned OR the tactical hack was in a different form.
  </notes>

